cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package, please cite it as below."
title: "NC25OL - Navigational Cybernetics 2.5 Open Ledger"
abstract: >-
  A domain-neutral connection contract for placing an execution boundary in
  front of an external adapter while preserving the declared Navigational
  Cybernetics 2.5 separation rules: sealed profiles and declarations, a
  two-gate evaluation, single-use permits, and a hash-chained audit ledger,
  with a standard-library reference engine, wire contract, and executable
  conformance suite.
